# onnxruntime-gpu 1.27+ on PyPI is built for CUDA 13 (cublasLt64_13 / libcublasLt.so.13) and
# silently falls back to the CPU next to these CUDA 12 wheels. 1.26 is the last CUDA 12 build,
# and CUDA 12 also keeps pre-Turing GPUs and older drivers working. Moving to CUDA 13 means
# swapping every nvidia-*-cu12 below for its CUDA 13 wheel in the same commit;
# tests/test_hardsub_providers.py checks that the two stay in step.
onnxruntime-gpu>=1.19,<1.27
nvidia-cublas-cu12
nvidia-cudnn-cu12>=9,<10
nvidia-cuda-runtime-cu12
nvidia-cufft-cu12
nvidia-curand-cu12
